#sortorder:7
#showas:疯狂 Zenith
Zany Zenith celebrates the Zenith factions, and introduces a couple of new AI concepts.  

This is an Encapsulated galaxy, with a standard complement of 80 planets.  

There are two AIs, both set to difficulty 7.  The Shield Hater AI specializes in attacking your forcefields, so protect your command stations well!  The Adaptive Moderate will switch between AI types in the Moderate category hourly, keeping you on your toes.

For the Zenith, the Devourer Golem, aka 'Cookie Monster', will indiscriminately attack any ships it runs into and is best avoided.  

The Zenith Trader sells it's wares - both to you and the AI - and enforces a cease-fire while it is around.  Check your build menu when it's on one of your planets!

Finally, there are a pair of Zenith Dyson Spheres, which dislike interference but can be a local ally against the AI in their part of the galaxy if you play your cards right ... or you can hack them as a source for ships to bolster your fleet if you are willing to tolerate a hostile response.  

None of these Zenith factions have a particularly large impact on their own, but collectively they should make the galaxy a bit more interesting.  